think that troll made the ball turn into a spider." "What?"

28
00:02:14.528 --> 00:02:20.046
Waldo squinted at the troll. "Why do you think that?" "The

29
00:02:20.047 --> 00:02:26.608
troll is wearing the same hoodie that the mystery girl and the squid monster wore," Ben replied. "She

30
